module.exports = [{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ有哪些使用场景","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ有哪些使用场景","level":"core","summary":"通用 MQ 场景（解耦、异步、削峰）见 13-MQ篇/拓展面试题/01.消息队列有哪…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"通用 MQ 场景（解耦、异步、削峰）见 "},{"t":"code","v":"13-MQ篇/拓展面试题/01.消息队列有哪些使用场景"},{"t":"text","v":"。RocketMQ 在国内电商、金融里用得广，口述时把 机制能力 和 业务例子 绑在一起讲。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"削峰填谷"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"大促下单、秒杀：网关把请求转成消息写入 Topic，订单/库存服务按固定并发从队列拉。RocketMQ 单 Broker 顺序写 CommitLog，吞吐高，适合短时流量洪峰缓冲。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"应用解耦"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"支付成功后要通知积分、风控、对账、短信。支付服务只发一条 "},{"t":"code","v":"PaySuccess"},{"t":"text","v":" 到 RocketMQ，各系统独立订阅 Tag 或不同 Consumer Group，互不影响发版节奏。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"异步提速"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"用户注册、提交审核：主链路写库后发 MQ 即返回；发邮件、生成 PDF、同步 ES 走异步消费，接口 RT 从几百毫秒降到几十毫秒量级。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"顺序业务"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同一订单的创建、支付、发货状态变更，需要按序处理。RocketMQ 用 同一 MessageQueue + 单线程消费该队列 保证局部顺序，比「全 Topic 全局顺序」更实用。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"事务最终一致"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"本地扣库存 + 发「创建订单成功」消息要对齐。用 RocketMQ 半消息 + Commit/Rollback + 回查，避免库成功消息没发、或消息发了库回滚。通用流程见拓展题 "},{"t":"code","v":"06.如何保证数据一致性事务消息如何实现"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"定时 / 延迟触达"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"会员到期提醒、订单超时未支付关单（有精度边界，见本篇 "},{"t":"code","v":"18"},{"t":"text","v":" 和 "},{"t":"code","v":"12"},{"t":"text","v":"）。RocketMQ 提供 固定延迟等级，适合「延迟档位」类需求，不是任意毫秒级定时器。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"金融与日志类"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"行情推送、交易流水异步落库、审计日志采集：需要低延迟、高可靠、可追踪 MessageId；RocketMQ 支持同步刷盘、同步复制、事务消息，和 Kafka 选型时常被拿来对比。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"口述时怎么串"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"先点 业务痛点（耦合、峰值、慢接口），再说 RocketMQ 哪块机制对上：CommitLog 扛写入、Consumer Group 扩消费、事务消息对账、MessageQueue 保顺序。别只背三个词。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不适合硬上的场景"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"强实时 RPC 替代、海量日志长期归档（更偏 Kafka/湖）、精确秒级定时（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"12"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"18"},{"t":"text","v":"）。选型过大题见拓展 "},{"t":"code","v":"02"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ有哪些使用场景-和-Kafka-在场景上怎么分","module":"rocketmq","title":"和 Kafka 在场景上怎么分","level":"extra","summary":"Kafka 偏日志流、大数据管道；RocketMQ 偏业务消息、事务、定时等级、顺序…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka 偏日志流、大数据管道；RocketMQ 偏业务消息、事务、定时等级、顺序订单类。不是绝对，看团队栈和运维习惯。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ有哪些使用场景"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ有哪些使用场景-小团队只有-Redis-List-行不行","module":"rocketmq","title":"小团队只有 Redis List 行不行","level":"extra","summary":"能扛简单异步，缺持久化策略、消费确认、堆积治理、事务消息。业务量上来或要 SLA，应…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"能扛简单异步，缺持久化策略、消费确认、堆积治理、事务消息。业务量上来或要 SLA，应上专业 MQ。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ有哪些使用场景"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的集群架构是怎样的","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ的集群架构是怎样的","level":"core","summary":"RocketMQ 是 NameServer + Broker + 客户端 的经典分布…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ 是 NameServer + Broker + 客户端 的经典分布式消息架构，没有 ZooKeeper 做注册中心，NameServer 轻量、无状态。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"四大角色"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Producer：业务发消息；启动后向 NameServer 拉 Topic 路由，再连 Broker 写 CommitLog。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Consumer：拉/长轮询消费；同样先查路由，再向对应 Broker 拉消息、提交 Offset。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"NameServer：维护 Topic 与 Broker 的映射、Broker 存活列表；Producer/Consumer 定时拉取路由表。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker：存消息、建 ConsumeQueue、处理生产消费请求；可 Master-Slave 或 DLedger 高可用。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"路由如何更新"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 启动向所有 NameServer 注册（Broker 地址、Topic、Queue 信息）。Producer/Consumer 每 30 秒左右（可配）从 NameServer 拉最新路由；Broker 与 NameServer 心跳断开后，NameServer 会剔除失效 Broker，客户端下次拉路由会避开。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"无单点注册中心"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"NameServer 可多实例部署，彼此 不复制数据，各存一份路由快照，最终一致。客户端配置多个 NameServer 地址，任一可用即可。对比：ZK/Eureka 强依赖注册集群一致性协议，RocketMQ 把复杂度压在 Broker 和客户端重试上。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"一条消息的路径（口述）"}]},{"type":"code","text":"sequenceDiagram\n  participant P as Producer\n  participant NS as NameServer\n  participant B as Broker\n  participant C as Consumer\n  P->>NS: 拉 Topic 路由\n  P->>B: Send 到某 MessageQueue\n  C->>NS: 拉路由\n  C->>B: Pull/Long Poll\n  C->>B: 更新消费位点"},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和通用架构题的关系"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"高可用、主从复制见拓展 "},{"t":"code","v":"04"},{"t":"text","v":" 与本篇 "},{"t":"code","v":"23"},{"t":"text","v":"；这里强调 RocketMQ 特有：NameServer 无状态 + Broker 存全量 CommitLog。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 内部（点到为止）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"请求线程收 Send/Pull → 写 CommitLog → 异步建 ConsumeQueue；HA 线程做 Master-Slave 复制。Consumer Offset 由 Broker 端 BrokerController 协调存储（集群模式）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"扩缩容印象"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"加 Broker Master 后要在 Topic 上 增加 Queue 才能用新机器；Producer/Consumer 自动 通过新路由发现，无需改代码（Queue 数变更要注意顺序哈希）。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的集群架构是怎样的-NameServer-挂了会怎样","module":"rocketmq","title":"NameServer 挂了会怎样","level":"extra","summary":"已缓存路由的客户端短时间还能发/收；新客户端或路由过期后无法发现 Broker，需多…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"已缓存路由的客户端短时间还能发/收；新客户端或路由过期后无法发现 Broker，需多 NameServer 实例。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的集群架构是怎样的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的集群架构是怎样的-Broker-之间会互相同步-Topic-吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"Broker 之间会互相同步 Topic 吗","level":"extra","summary":"不会。每个 Broker 存自己负责的 Queue；Topic 逻辑名相同，物理 Q…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不会。每个 Broker 存自己负责的 Queue；Topic 逻辑名相同，物理 Queue 分布在不同 Broker 上，靠路由表定位。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的集群架构是怎样的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Broker有哪几种集群模式","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ的Broker有哪几种集群模式","level":"core","summary":"Broker 集群模式决定 可用性、读扩展、故障切换 怎么搞。4.x 常见 Mast…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 集群模式决定 可用性、读扩展、故障切换 怎么搞。4.x 常见 Master-Slave；5.x / 4.5+ 可上 DLedger 自动选主。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"单 Master"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"只有一个 Broker 进程（无 Slave）。部署简单，单点故障：宕机则该 Broker 上所有 Queue 不可读写。只适合 dev/POC，生产不推荐。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"多 Master"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"多个 Master，各自独立存自己的 CommitLog，无 Slave。某 Master 挂了，只丢该节点上的 Queue；其他 Master 正常。写能力横向扩展好，但 没有热备，故障时要等运维恢复或迁移 Queue。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"多 Master 多 Slave（异步/同步复制）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"每个 Master 挂一个或多个 Slave。Master 写 CommitLog，Slave 同步或异步 复制（"},{"t":"code","v":"SYNC_MASTER"},{"t":"text","v":" / "},{"t":"code","v":"ASYNC_MASTER"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"读可以从 Slave 分担（配置允许时），写仍在 Master。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Master 宕机：异步复制可能 丢最后几条；同步复制已确认的消息更安全，但 RT 更高。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"切换：传统模式常需 人工改配置 把 Slave 提 Master，或用运维脚本；不是内置自动 Raft 切换。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"DLedger 模式（自动主从切换）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"基于 Raft 的多副本 CommitLog（DLedger），一组 Broker 选 Leader 对外读写，Follower 复制。Leader 挂了 自动选新 Leader，RPO/RTO 比手工切换好。口述时记：4.x 高可用进阶方案，部署比经典 Master-Slave 复杂，磁盘与节点数要规划好。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"怎么选（面试口径）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"要简单、能容忍手工切换：多 Master + 多 Slave + 同步复制（核心 Topic）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"要自动 failover：DLedger 或云厂商托管 RocketMQ。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"只要吞吐、能接受单点：多 Master（非核心链路）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 NameServer 的关系"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"无论哪种 Broker 模式，都向 NameServer 注册 BrokerId、角色、地址；Consumer 路由里会看到 Broker 列表，不直接感知 DLedger 内部选主细节。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"读写权限"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Slave 默认 不可写；Master 宕机未提升时，该 BrokerName 下 Queue 不可生产。DLedger 组内由 Leader 统一写。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"部署习惯"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生产常见 2M-2S 或 多组 Master-Slave 分 Topic；全异步复制要 书面接受 极端丢消息窗口，核心链路透传同步。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"4.x 与 5.x 印象"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"4.x 以 经典 Master-Slave + NameServer 为主；5.x 在 Proxy、Pop 消费、定时消息 等演进，集群模式选型仍以 Master-Slave / DLedger 口述为主，细节看版本文档。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Broker有哪几种集群模式-Master-宕机-Consumer-会怎样","module":"rocketmq","title":"Master 宕机 Consumer 会怎样","level":"extra","summary":"路由仍可能指向旧 Master，拉取失败后会重试、刷新路由；Slave 未提升时该 …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"路由仍可能指向旧 Master，拉取失败后会重试、刷新路由；Slave 未提升时该 Queue 不可用，堆积在 Producer 侧或发送失败。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Broker有哪几种集群模式"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Broker有哪几种集群模式-SYNC_MASTER-和刷盘-SYNC_FLUSH-是一回事吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"SYNC_MASTER 和刷盘 SYNC_FLUSH 是一回事吗","level":"extra","summary":"不是。复制是 Master→Slave；刷盘是 Broker 进程→磁盘。两者都开，…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不是。复制是 Master→Slave；刷盘是 Broker 进程→磁盘。两者都开，可靠性最高，延迟也最大。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Broker有哪几种集群模式"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Producer是如何发送消息的","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ的Producer是如何发送消息的","level":"core","summary":"Producer 发消息不是瞎连 Broker，而是 先拿路由 → 选 Queue …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Producer 发消息不是瞎连 Broker，而是 先拿路由 → 选 Queue → 发请求 → 等 ACK/重试。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"启动与路由"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Producer 指定 Producer Group（事务、故障排查会用到）。向 NameServer 拉取 TopicRouteData：有哪些 Broker、每个 Broker 上该 Topic 有几个 MessageQueue、读写权限等。路由本地缓存，过期再拉。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"选 MessageQueue"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"默认 轮询 分散到各 Queue，利于并行消费。可自定义："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"顺序消息：按业务 key（如 orderId）哈希到固定 Queue。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"故障规避：某 Broker 不可用则跳过其 Queue。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"延迟消息：走内部 Schedule Topic，再投递到目标 Topic（机制见 "},{"t":"code","v":"12"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"发送方式"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同步 send：等 Broker 返回 SendResult（含 MessageId、QueueOffset），适合要确认再往下走的场景。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"异步 send：回调里处理成功/失败，吞吐高，注意背压和线程池。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Oneway：发出去不等结果，可能丢，只适合日志类可丢。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 侧简要流程"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 收到 PUT_MESSAGE，追加 CommitLog，异步构建 ConsumeQueue 索引，按刷盘/复制配置返回 ACK。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"失败与重试"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"网络超时、Broker 忙、NOT_MASTER 等会触发 默认重试（同步默认 2 次，可配）。重试可能换 Queue，非顺序 Topic 一般无妨；顺序 Topic 需用 MessageQueueSelector 保证仍进同一 Queue。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"事务消息入口"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"事务 Producer 先发 半消息（"},{"t":"code","v":"prepare"},{"t":"text","v":"），再走本地事务与 Commit/Rollback，见 "},{"t":"code","v":"11"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生产注意点"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消息体别过大（默认约 4MB 级，可配）；超大走 OSS + 消息里传 URL。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"合理设置 超时 与 重试次数，避免放大 Broker 压力。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"SendResult 看什么"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"msgId"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"queueOffset"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"messageQueue"},{"t":"text","v":"（落在哪台 Broker 哪条 Queue）、"},{"t":"code","v":"sendStatus"},{"t":"text","v":"。排查 顺序乱、重复 时常对照 QueueId。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"压缩与属性"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Body 可压缩；UserProperty 供 SQL92 过滤；Keys 建 Index 与业务追踪；Tags 订阅过滤。属性别塞太大，影响存储与过滤性能。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Producer是如何发送消息的-怎么保证发到指定-Broker","module":"rocketmq","title":"怎么保证发到指定 Broker","level":"extra","summary":"不能指定 Broker，只能指定 Topic + Queue 序号（或 select…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不能指定 Broker，只能指定 Topic + Queue 序号（或 selector 算法）。路由决定 Queue 落在哪个 Broker。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Producer是如何发送消息的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Producer是如何发送消息的-发送失败业务库已提交怎么办","module":"rocketmq","title":"发送失败业务库已提交怎么办","level":"extra","summary":"典型用 事务消息 或 本地消息表；普通 send 失败要业务补偿或重发，见可靠传输拓…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"典型用 事务消息 或 本地消息表；普通 send 失败要业务补偿或重发，见可靠传输拓展题。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Producer是如何发送消息的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Consumer是如何消费消息的","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ的Consumer是如何消费消息的","level":"core","summary":"Consumer 属于某个 Consumer Group。集群模式下 同组实例分摊 …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Consumer 属于某个 Consumer Group。集群模式下 同组实例分摊 Queue；广播模式下 每组实例各消费全量（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"16"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"负载与 Rebalance"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"组内消费者启动、下线、Broker 扩缩容会触发 Rebalance：把 Topic 下所有 MessageQueue 分配 给当前在线 Consumer 实例。常见策略印象：平均分配、轮询、一致性哈希（按 ConsumerId），具体以实现为准。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"每个 Consumer 实例本地维护 分配到哪些 Queue。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"拉取消息"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"向 Broker 发 Pull 请求（SDK 里可能叫 Push，底层仍是长轮询 Pull）。带上 Offset，Broker 从 CommitLog 经 ConsumeQueue 定位返回一批消息。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"本地消费"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"默认 并发消费：拉到的消息丢进本地线程池，多条并行 "},{"t":"code","v":"consumeMessage"},{"t":"text","v":"。顺序消费则 单 Queue 单线程 顺序执行（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"13"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"提交 Offset"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费成功后 Commit Offset 到 Broker（集群模式存 Broker 或 Broker 协调；广播存本地文件）。失败可 重试队列 延迟再投，次数用尽进死信（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"25"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费模式"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"CLUSTERING：组内一条消息只被一个实例消费。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"BROADCASTING：组内每个实例都收到一份。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"流控与挂起"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"本地堆积过多或线程池满时，Consumer 会 降低拉取频率，避免 OOM；面试可提「消费速度要匹配生产」。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Producer 对称点"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"都依赖 NameServer 路由；Consumer 只连 分配到的 Queue 所在 Broker 拉取。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费超时"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"consumeTimeout"},{"t":"text","v":" 过长会占线程；过短慢 SQL 会被判失败进 重试。要和下游 P99 对齐。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"从最新还是最早消费"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"CONSUME_FROM_LAST_OFFSET"},{"t":"text","v":" 新 Group 从队尾；要 补历史 需改策略或手动 Offset，运维慎用。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Consumer是如何消费消息的-Rebalance-期间会重复消费吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"Rebalance 期间会重复消费吗","level":"extra","summary":"可能。分配变更时 Offset 提交若未对齐，会出现 重复 或短暂 漏消费，业务要幂…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"可能。分配变更时 Offset 提交若未对齐，会出现 重复 或短暂 漏消费，业务要幂等（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"24"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Consumer是如何消费消息的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Consumer是如何消费消息的-一次拉多少条","module":"rocketmq","title":"一次拉多少条","level":"extra","summary":"pullBatchSize、consumeMessageBatchMaxSize 等…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"pullBatchSize"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"consumeMessageBatchMaxSize"},{"t":"text","v":" 等可配；过大拉长单次处理时间，过小增加 RT。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Consumer是如何消费消息的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消费消息是推模式还是拉模式","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ消费消息是推模式还是拉模式","level":"core","summary":"结论先说：API 叫 DefaultMQPushConsumer，本质是 Broke…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"结论先说：API 叫 DefaultMQPushConsumer，本质是 Broker 上的长轮询 Pull。不是 Broker 主动 TCP 推到你机器上那种经典 Push。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Push SDK 的真实行为"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Consumer 内部有 PullMessageService 循环向 Broker 发 Pull 请求，挂起等待（long polling）：有消息立刻返回，没消息 Broker hold 一段时间（如 5s）再空返，客户端立刻再 Pull。对用户像「消息来了就回调」，所以叫 Push。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和真 Push 的区别"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"真 Push 是 Broker 维护连接、有消息就下行。RocketMQ Broker 不维护海量 Consumer 长推，而是 Consumer 拉，便于 流控：Consumer 自己决定拉多快、拉多少。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pull 模式 API"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"也有 DefaultMQPullConsumer，业务自己循环 "},{"t":"code","v":"pull"},{"t":"text","v":"、自己管 Offset，灵活但代码重。大数据批处理、自定义节奏会用。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Kafka 对比一句"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka Consumer 也是 Pull（poll），协调通过 Group Coordinator；RocketMQ 用 NameServer 路由 + Broker Pull/Long Poll。两者都不是传统 MQ 的 broker-push。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"面试怎么答"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"「我们用的是 Push 消费者，但实现上是 长轮询 Pull，好处是消费端能根据本地线程池和堆积 背压，不会 Broker 一股脑推爆客户端。」"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"长轮询好处"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"减少空轮询 CPU；有消息低延迟；没消息时不频繁请求。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"关键参数印象"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"pullInterval"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"pullBatchSize"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"brokerSuspendMaxTimeMillis"},{"t":"text","v":" 影响拉取节奏；本地 "},{"t":"code","v":"consumeConcurrentlyMaxSpan"},{"t":"text","v":" 等影响 何时暂停拉取（背压）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"推拉选型"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"一般业务 Push 封装足够；要精确控制 Offset、批量扫历史用 Pull。别在面试里把 RocketMQ 说成「Broker 主动推」。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消费消息是推模式还是拉模式-为什么不用真-Push","module":"rocketmq","title":"为什么不用真 Push","level":"extra","summary":"连接数、Broker 内存与 fan-out 压力大；拉模式把速率控制权交给 Con…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"连接数、Broker 内存与 fan-out 压力大；拉模式把速率控制权交给 Consumer，更适合互联网海量消费者。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消费消息是推模式还是拉模式"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消费消息是推模式还是拉模式-Pull-会不会消息延迟","module":"rocketmq","title":"Pull 会不会消息延迟","level":"extra","summary":"long polling 下延迟接近 Push；主要延迟来自 消费慢、堆积，不是 P…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"long polling 下延迟接近 Push；主要延迟来自 消费慢、堆积，不是 Pull 模型本身。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消费消息是推模式还是拉模式"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息是如何存储的","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ消息是如何存储的","level":"core","summary":"RocketMQ Broker 磁盘模型是 所有 Topic 共用一份 Commit…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ Broker 磁盘模型是 所有 Topic 共用一份 CommitLog 顺序写，再派生出 ConsumeQueue 和 IndexFile，不是每个 Topic 一个独立大文件乱写。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"CommitLog"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"物理上通常 "},{"t":"code","v":"~/store/commitlog/"},{"t":"text","v":" 下多个 1GB 分段文件。任意 Topic 的消息 追加写同一条日志，顺序 IO，利于 PageCache 和吞吐。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"单条记录含：消息长度、魔数、Body、Topic、QueueId、QueueOffset、物理 Offset 等。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ConsumeQueue"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"逻辑队列索引，路径按 "},{"t":"code","v":"Topic/QueueId"},{"t":"text","v":" 分目录。每条索引固定约 20 字节 级（版本略有差异）：CommitLog Offset、Size、Tag HashCode 等，不存完整 Body。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Consumer 按 Queue + Offset 读 ConsumeQueue → 拿到 CommitLog 位置 → 随机读 一条完整消息。多 Topic 共享 CommitLog，ConsumeQueue 只是「指针表」。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"IndexFile"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"可选，按 Message Key 建哈希索引，方便按业务 key 查历史消息（运维、对账）。不是消费主路径。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"写入路径"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Producer Send → Broker 串行/池化写 CommitLog → 异步 ReputMessageService 分发，构建各 Topic 的 ConsumeQueue 条目。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"读取路径"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Consumer Pull → 读 ConsumeQueue 条目 → 读 CommitLog → 返回消息 batch。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Kafka 类比"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka 是 Partition 独立 Log；RocketMQ 是 全局 CommitLog + 多 ConsumeQueue。口述重点：写集中顺序、读按 Queue 分散。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"延迟与事务消息存哪"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"延迟、事务半消息走 系统 Topic，最终仍进 CommitLog；排查问题时 Topic 名常带 "},{"t":"code","v":"RMQ_SYS_"},{"t":"text","v":" 前缀。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"文件与 Offset"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"CommitLog 物理 Offset 全局递增；ConsumeQueue 里是 逻辑 QueueOffset 与 CommitLog 物理位置映射，两套 offset 别混。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息是如何存储的-为什么-ConsumeQueue-不存-Body","module":"rocketmq","title":"为什么 ConsumeQueue 不存 Body","level":"extra","summary":"减索引体积、加快构建；Body 只在 CommitLog 存一份，空间换时间。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"减索引体积、加快构建；Body 只在 CommitLog 存一份，空间换时间。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息是如何存储的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息是如何存储的-消息存在内存还是磁盘","module":"rocketmq","title":"消息存在内存还是磁盘","level":"extra","summary":"先写 PageCache（mmap 映射 CommitLog），再按刷盘策略落盘；消…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"先写 PageCache（mmap 映射 CommitLog），再按刷盘策略落盘；消费常命中 PageCache，热数据极快。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息是如何存储的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的存储模型和底层优化策略有哪些","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ的存储模型和底层优化策略有哪些","level":"core","summary":"在 CommitLog + ConsumeQueue 模型上，RocketMQ 靠 …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"在 CommitLog + ConsumeQueue 模型上，RocketMQ 靠 顺序写、内核页缓存、零拷贝、mmap、异步构建索引 做性能优化。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"顺序写 CommitLog"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"机械盘/SSD 都对 顺序写 友好。所有消息 append 同一日志，避免多文件随机写放大 IOPS。ConsumeQueue 也是顺序 append 小条目。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"PageCache 与 mmap"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"CommitLog、ConsumeQueue 通过 mmap 映射文件，写入走 PageCache，由内核异步刷脏页。热 Topic 读写大量命中内存，延迟低。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"零拷贝（Consume 路径）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 读消息给 Consumer 时，常用 sendfile / mmap + write 一类路径，减少用户态拷贝次数（具体随版本与传输层略有差异）。口述：尽量让数据从 PageCache 直达网卡缓冲区。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"异步刷盘 vs 同步刷盘"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ASYNC_FLUSH：写到 PageCache 即返 ACK，吞吐高，进程 crash 可能丢未刷盘数据。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"SYNC_FLUSH：每批或每条 fsync，延迟升，数据更安全。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"主从复制策略"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ASYNC_MASTER：Master 返 ACK 不等 Slave；SYNC_MASTER：Slave 确认后才返 ACK。与刷盘策略 正交组合，生产按 Topic 分级。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ConsumeQueue 轻量"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"索引条目小，构建可 异步 Reput，不阻塞 CommitLog 写入主路径。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"文件预分配"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"CommitLog / ConsumeQueue 预创建、预分配 空间，避免运行时频繁 extend 元数据开销。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"读优化"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Consumer 顺序读同一 Queue 的 ConsumeQueue，再读 CommitLog 局部区间，利于 预读 和 Cache 命中。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"TransientStorePool（了解）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"部分版本支持 堆外缓冲 再批量 commit 到 CommitLog，进一步减锁；是否开启看版本与压测。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"面试收束"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"存储优化口径：顺序 append + mmap PageCache + 轻量 ConsumeQueue 异步建索引 + 按 SLA 选刷盘复制。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的存储模型和底层优化策略有哪些-mmap-有什么坑","module":"rocketmq","title":"mmap 有什么坑","level":"extra","summary":"Broker 进程 OOM、机器掉电时 PageCache 未落盘会丢；核心链路配 …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 进程 OOM、机器掉电时 PageCache 未落盘会丢；核心链路配 SYNC_FLUSH + SYNC_MASTER。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的存储模型和底层优化策略有哪些"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的存储模型和底层优化策略有哪些-和-Kafka-zero-copy-一样吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"和 Kafka zero-copy 一样吗","level":"extra","summary":"思想类似，实现栈不同；RocketMQ 强在 单 CommitLog 写 + 轻量 …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"思想类似，实现栈不同；RocketMQ 强在 单 CommitLog 写 + 轻量 ConsumeQueue，Kafka 强在 Partition 并行与生态。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的存储模型和底层优化策略有哪些"},{"id":"rocketmq-为什么RocketMQ一个CommitLog文件就能抗住百万QPS","module":"rocketmq","title":"为什么RocketMQ一个CommitLog文件就能抗住百万QPS","level":"core","summary":"面试别吹「一定百万」，讲 为什么单日志写能撑高吞吐 的原理；实际数字看机器、消息大小…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"面试别吹「一定百万」，讲 为什么单日志写能撑高吞吐 的原理；实际数字看机器、消息大小、刷盘与复制配置。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"顺序写 + PageCache"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"所有 Topic 写入 一条 CommitLog，磁盘看到的是 大块顺序 append。Linux 会把写入缓存在 PageCache，异步刷盘，写路径极短，CPU 主要做内存拷贝和编码，不是频繁 fsync。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"读路径不拖写"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Consumer 不扫 CommitLog 全文件，而是 ConsumeQueue 定址，读放大可控。索引条目固定很小，构建还 异步，写 CommitLog 的主线程/管道不被消费拖死。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"无分区锁竞争（写侧）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"相对「每 Partition 一个文件」模型，单 Broker 上 一个写入口 顺序追加，避免多文件锁与随机写。横向扩展靠 多 Master 多 Broker，单机靠 CommitLog 吃满磁盘顺序带宽。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"网络与批处理"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Producer 可 batch send；Broker 处理 pipeline 化；Consumer long poll batch pull。QPS 是 端到端 指标，不单是磁盘。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"瓶颈会在哪"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"开启 SYNC_FLUSH + SYNC_MASTER 时，QPS 会 数量级下降，这是可靠性换吞吐。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消息体很大、Tag 过滤在服务端很重、磁盘带宽打满，都会下来。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"百万级多见于 异步刷盘、小消息、压测场景，生产口述用「顺序写 CommitLog 是 RocketMQ 高吞吐核心」即可。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Kafka 口述差异"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka 多 Partition 并行写多个 log segment；RocketMQ 单 Broker 单 CommitLog 顺序写 + 多 Queue 逻辑并行，扩展方式不同。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"压测与生产的差距"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Benchmark 常 异步刷盘、小 payload、少订阅；一上 SYNC 复制和 fat 消息，QPS 会下来，回答时要 带条件。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"单机上限之后"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"水平加 Broker Master，Topic Queue 数 与 Producer 轮询一起把写分散到多机 CommitLog，而不是单机死磕百万。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"面试官追问「真百万吗」"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"答：原理上顺序写 + PageCache 能到很高写入速率；线上要扣消息大小、同步策略、副本、网络，数字用压测报告说话，不要背死「一定 100 万」。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-为什么RocketMQ一个CommitLog文件就能抗住百万QPS-单-CommitLog-会不会成为热点","module":"rocketmq","title":"单 CommitLog 会不会成为热点","level":"extra","summary":"单机单写点，靠磁盘顺序带宽和 PageCache；不够就 加 Broker Mast…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"单机单写点，靠磁盘顺序带宽和 PageCache；不够就 加 Broker Master，Topic Queue 分散到多机。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-为什么RocketMQ一个CommitLog文件就能抗住百万QPS"},{"id":"rocketmq-为什么RocketMQ一个CommitLog文件就能抗住百万QPS-SSD-和-HDD-差别","module":"rocketmq","title":"SSD 和 HDD 差别","level":"extra","summary":"HDD 更吃顺序写优势；SSD 随机也好，但 CommitLog 模型仍减文件管理与…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"HDD 更吃顺序写优势；SSD 随机也好，但 CommitLog 模型仍减文件管理与碎片问题。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-为什么RocketMQ一个CommitLog文件就能抗住百万QPS"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证消息不丢失","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ如何保证消息不丢失","level":"core","summary":"通用「生产-存储-消费」三阶段见拓展 07.如何保证消息的可靠性传输。RocketM…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"通用「生产-存储-消费」三阶段见拓展 "},{"t":"code","v":"07.如何保证消息的可靠性传输"},{"t":"text","v":"。RocketMQ 落地靠 ACK、刷盘、主从复制、消费确认 组合，没有单一开关。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生产阶段"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同步发送：等 Broker "},{"t":"code","v":"SendStatus.SEND_OK"},{"t":"text","v":" 再认为发出；异步/Oneway 可能丢。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"失败重试：默认有限次重试；仍失败要 业务告警、落库补偿。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"事务消息：半消息落盘后再做本地事务，避免「库有了消息没有」（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"11"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 存储阶段"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"SYNC_FLUSH：消息 fsync 到磁盘再 ACK（或按配置批次）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"SYNC_MASTER：Slave 同步成功 Master 才 ACK Producer。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"两者都异步时：进程 crash 或 Master 宕机 可能丢未复制数据，和拓展题里「最多一次/至少一次」 trade-off 一致。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费阶段"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"业务 处理成功后再返回 CONSUME_SUCCESS，才推进 Offset。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"处理中 crash：消息 未确认，会 重新投递 → 可能重复，要幂等（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"24"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不要先 commit Offset 再干慢活（除非自己保证补偿）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"运维与架构"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"多 Master 多 Slave / DLedger，避免单 Broker 全挂。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"监控 堆积、刷盘耗时、复制 lag。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"磁盘满、过期策略误删会导致「业务以为还在」，要水位告警（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"17"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"口述模板"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"「金融核心 Topic：同步 send + SYNC_FLUSH + SYNC_MASTER；消费端幂等；非核心日志 Topic 可异步刷盘换吞吐。」"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"常见踩坑"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"异步 send 却当 必达 写库后不做补偿。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Master 宕机 异步复制 未提升就以为消息一定在。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费里 先 ACK 再调外部，外部失败消息却丢了。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"磁盘水位删文件（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"17"},{"t":"text","v":"）与「不丢」混淆。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Exactly Once"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ 不保证端到端 只消费一次；「不丢」+ 幂等 ≈ 业务上的可靠最终处理。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"三阶段串联答法"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"发：同步 + 重试；存：刷盘 + 复制；消费：成功后提交 Offset + 幂等表。缺任一环节都可能「以为发了其实没有」或「重复处理」。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证消息不丢失-只开-SYNC_FLUSH-够不够","module":"rocketmq","title":"只开 SYNC_FLUSH 够不够","level":"extra","summary":"Master 磁盘有了但 Slave 没有，Master 机房全毁仍可能丢；核心要再…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Master 磁盘有了但 Slave 没有，Master 机房全毁仍可能丢；核心要再加 SYNC_MASTER 或多副本 DLedger。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证消息不丢失"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证消息不丢失-消息进了-Broker-算不丢吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"消息进了 Broker 算不丢吗","level":"extra","summary":"算 Broker 承诺；Consumer 挂、业务抛异常仍会重投，属于 至少一次，不…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"算 Broker 承诺；Consumer 挂、业务抛异常仍会重投，属于 至少一次，不是「只投一次」。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证消息不丢失"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ事务消息是如何实现的","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ事务消息是如何实现的","level":"core","summary":"与拓展 06.如何保证数据一致性事务消息如何实现 同一套路；这里补 RocketMQ…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"与拓展 "},{"t":"code","v":"06.如何保证数据一致性事务消息如何实现"},{"t":"text","v":" 同一套路；这里补 RocketMQ 专有名词与回查。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"角色"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"TransactionProducer：发半消息、执行本地事务、Commit/Rollback、处理回查。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker：存半消息、对消费者不可见；收二阶段指令；超时 回查 Producer。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"TransactionListener（或旧版回调）："},{"t":"code","v":"executeLocalTransaction"},{"t":"text","v":" + "},{"t":"code","v":"checkLocalTransaction"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"正常流程"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Producer 发 Half Message 到 Broker 内部 Topic（如 "},{"t":"code","v":"RMQ_SYS_TRANS_HALF_TOPIC"},{"t":"text","v":"），Broker 持久化。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 返回 UNKNOWN / 半消息 OK，Producer 执行 本地事务（写库、调 RPC）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"本地成功 → "},{"t":"code","v":"commitMessage"},{"t":"text","v":"；失败 → "},{"t":"code","v":"rollbackMessage"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Commit：Broker 把消息转到目标 Topic，对消费者可见；Rollback：删除半消息。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"回查机制"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Commit/Rollback 请求丢失或 Producer 重启时，Broker 对长时间未决半消息 发起 check。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Producer 的 "},{"t":"code","v":"checkLocalTransaction"},{"t":"text","v":" 查本地状态（按业务单号）：COMMIT / ROLLBACK / UNKNOWN。UNKNOWN 会再回查，直到有结论或超限。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和本地消息表对比"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ 把「待发/已发」状态放在 Broker 半消息 + 回查，业务不必扫消息表；但要保证回查接口 幂等、可查。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"限制口述"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不支持任意跨库 XA 强一致，是 最终一致。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费端仍可能重复，要 幂等。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"5.x API 与 4.x 监听接口略有差异，流程不变。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"简图"}]},{"type":"code","text":"sequenceDiagram\n  participant P as Producer\n  participant B as Broker\n  participant C as Consumer\n  P->>B: Half Message\n  P->>P: 本地事务\n  P->>B: Commit/Rollback\n  B->>C: 可投递（Commit 后）"},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"异常分支"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"本地事务 UNKNOWN（如 RPC 超时）会依赖 回查；业务要能根据单号判定最终状态，不能永远 UNKNOWN。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和普通消息对比"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"普通 send 成功即消费者可见；事务消息 Commit 前消费者不可见，适合「本地库与消息同时生效」的编排。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ事务消息是如何实现的-半消息消费者能看到吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"半消息消费者能看到吗","level":"extra","summary":"不能，未 Commit 前只在 Broker 内部状态，普通 Consumer 拉不…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不能，未 Commit 前只在 Broker 内部状态，普通 Consumer 拉不到。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ事务消息是如何实现的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ事务消息是如何实现的-回查太频繁怎么办","module":"rocketmq","title":"回查太频繁怎么办","level":"extra","summary":"本地事务表记录状态；check 快速返回 COMMIT/ROLLBACK；避免在 c…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"本地事务表记录状态；check 快速返回 COMMIT/ROLLBACK；避免在 check 里做重逻辑。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ事务消息是如何实现的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ延迟消息是如何实现的","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ延迟消息是如何实现的","level":"core","summary":"RocketMQ 不是任意 delayTime 的定时器；4.x 经典实现是 固定延…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ 不是任意 delayTime 的定时器；4.x 经典实现是 固定延迟等级（如 1s、5s、10s、30s、1m、2m… 到 2h，共 18 档，可配 "},{"t":"code","v":"messageDelayLevel"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生产者怎么用"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"发消息时设 "},{"t":"code","v":"delayTimeLevel"},{"t":"text","v":"（等级编号，不是毫秒时间戳）。例如 level=3 表示第 3 档对应延迟。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 内部机制（口述）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"带 delay 的消息先写到 Schedule Topic（内部多个 Queue，按等级对应）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ScheduleMessageService 定时扫描，到期后 重写 为目标 Topic 的普通消息，进入正常 CommitLog/ConsumeQueue。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Consumer 只消费 目标 Topic，感知为「延迟后到达」。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"5.x 定时消息"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"5.x 引入 定时/延时新机制（基于时间戳的定时消息能力增强，以所用版本文档为准）。面试 4.x 环境 以等级为主；5.x 可提「支持更灵活的定时投递，仍要查版本边界」。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和拓展「延迟队列」关系"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"通用概念见 "},{"t":"code","v":"03.死信队列和延迟队列"},{"t":"text","v":"；RocketMQ 落地记住 等级表 + 内部 Schedule Topic，不是 Redis ZSET 那种任意 score。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"业务注意"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"订单 精确 30 分钟关单 用固定等级 对不齐，见 "},{"t":"code","v":"18"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"大量延迟消息会压 Schedule 扫描，要监控内部 Topic 堆积。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"与重试队列区别"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费失败 重试 也走延迟等级投递 "},{"t":"code","v":"%RETRY%"},{"t":"text","v":" Topic，和 业务延迟消息 不同链路，别混在一个 Topic 里排查。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"等级表运维"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"broker.conf"},{"t":"text","v":" 的 "},{"t":"code","v":"messageDelayLevel"},{"t":"text","v":" 可改档位字符串；改完要 重启 Broker，且与客户端约定一致。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"适用场景举例"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"支付后 10 分钟未确认 发短信提醒（档位近似即可）；不是 精确关单（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"18"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ延迟消息是如何实现的-能发「明天-9-点」吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"能发「明天 9 点」吗","level":"extra","summary":"4.x 固定等级不行；5.x 定时能力看版本；生产更常用 调度平台 / 时间轮 / …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"4.x 固定等级不行；5.x 定时能力看版本；生产更常用 调度平台 / 时间轮 / DB 扫描 做精确触发。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ延迟消息是如何实现的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ延迟消息是如何实现的-delayTimeLevel-传毫秒行吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"delayTimeLevel 传毫秒行吗","level":"extra","summary":"不行，传的是 等级 index，传错会导致延迟不符合预期。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不行，传的是 等级 index，传错会导致延迟不符合预期。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ延迟消息是如何实现的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证消息顺序","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ如何保证消息顺序","level":"core","summary":"全局顺序一般不搞；RocketMQ 保证的是 同一个 MessageQueue 内 …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"全局顺序一般不搞；RocketMQ 保证的是 同一个 MessageQueue 内 FIFO。拓展题 "},{"t":"code","v":"05.如何保证消息的顺序性"},{"t":"text","v":" 讲通用原则，这里讲 RocketMQ 怎么选 Queue、怎么消费。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生产端：进同一 Queue"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同一业务键（如 orderId）必须进 同一个 MessageQueue："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"自定义 MessageQueueSelector，对 key 哈希再 "},{"t":"code","v":"% queueSize"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同一 orderId 始终映射到同一 QueueId（Queue 数量不变的前提下）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Queue 数扩容会导致哈希变化，顺序可能乱，扩容时要 业务降级或双写过渡。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 端"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"单 Queue 对应 ConsumeQueue 顺序 append；CommitLog 虽混写，但每条消息带 QueueOffset，按 Queue 读仍有序。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费端：单 Queue 单线程"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"使用 MessageListenerOrderly（顺序监听），对 分配到本机的每个 Queue 串行消费。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不要用并发 Listener 消费同一顺序 Topic。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费失败会 阻塞该 Queue 重试，保证不乱序（但会卡住后续消息）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和并发消费对比"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"并发 Listener 多线程处理 同一 Queue 的不同消息，完成顺序不确定，破坏顺序。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"局部顺序场景"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"「同一订单有序、不同订单并行」：key 选 orderId + 多 Queue 并行，是 RocketMQ 最常见顺序方案。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"失败与重试"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"顺序消费下一条会等上一条 SUCCESS；持续失败会进重试/死信，该 Queue 后续消息被挂起，要快速处理 poison message。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"多类型顺序"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"若只需「同一订单有序」，不同订单并行：MessageQueueSelector 按 orderId 即可，不必全局单 Queue。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"与通用题衔接"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"拓展 "},{"t":"code","v":"05"},{"t":"text","v":" 讲「同 key 进同一分区/队列 + 单线程消费」；RocketMQ 落地就是 Selector + MessageListenerOrderly。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证消息顺序-只用一个-Queue-行不行","module":"rocketmq","title":"只用一个 Queue 行不行","level":"extra","summary":"全局顺序可以，但 吞吐极差，一般不推荐；用 key 哈希多 Queue。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"全局顺序可以，但 吞吐极差，一般不推荐；用 key 哈希多 Queue。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证消息顺序"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证消息顺序-发送失败重试换-Queue-会怎样","module":"rocketmq","title":"发送失败重试换 Queue 会怎样","level":"extra","summary":"默认重试可能换 Queue，顺序消息要 自定义重试逻辑 或仍选同一 Queue（SD…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"默认重试可能换 Queue，顺序消息要 自定义重试逻辑 或仍选同一 Queue（SDK 提供顺序相关配置/实现注意点）。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证消息顺序"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息积压问题如何解决","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ消息积压问题如何解决","level":"core","summary":"积压 = 生产速度 > 消费速度，或 Consumer 挂了、慢 SQL、下游超时。…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"积压 = 生产速度 > 消费速度，或 Consumer 挂了、慢 SQL、下游超时。先 找根因，再谈扩容技巧；通用思路与 Kafka 类似，RocketMQ 特有 Queue 数、Rebalance、迁移。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"排查根因"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"看 Consumer 消费 TPS、RT、线程池是否满、是否频繁 Full GC。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"看 下游 DB/接口 是否变慢；单条消息处理是否过重。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"看 Consumer 实例数 是否少于 Queue 数（部分 Queue 无人消费）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"看是否 消费失败重试 放大流量。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"扩消费者"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同 Group 加实例，Rebalance 后分摊 Queue。注意：实例数 ≤ Queue 总数 才有意义；Queue 不够要 扩 Topic Queue 数（需规划，可能影响顺序哈希）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"优化消费逻辑"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"批量写库、异步化非关键步骤、缓存、限流保护下游； poison message 进死信，别无限重试堵 Queue。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"临时分流（应急）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"开 临时 Consumer Group 只消费不处理（或落冷存储），先 清堆积——数据要后续补偿，风险大，仅应急。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"或 新 Topic 转发 由更强集群消费（运维脚本 + 单独消费者）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"扩 Broker / 生产侧"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"若 Broker CPU、磁盘 IO 打满，加 Master、分散 Topic；Producer 侧避免无意义重试风暴。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"别只加机器"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"下游数据库到瓶颈，加 Consumer 只会 把 DB 打挂，积压更深。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"监控"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ Console / Prometheus：堆积量、消费延迟、Broker 入队 TPS；告警早于用户投诉。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"临时扩容 Consumer 无效的情况"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Queue 数 = 4、Consumer 已有 8 台，再加人 不增加并行度；要先加 Queue 或优化单条耗时。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"与死信联动"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"慢消费 + 无限重试会把 RETRY Topic 也堆满； poison 消息应 尽快 DLQ（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"25"},{"t":"text","v":"），释放正常消息。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息积压问题如何解决-堆积在-Broker-会丢吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"堆积在 Broker 会丢吗","level":"extra","summary":"默认按 保留时间/磁盘水位 删旧消息（见 17），堆太久可能 过期被删，不是无限缓冲…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"默认按 保留时间/磁盘水位 删旧消息（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"17"},{"t":"text","v":"），堆太久可能 过期被删，不是无限缓冲。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息积压问题如何解决"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息积压问题如何解决-顺序-Topic-积压能狂加-Consumer-吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"顺序 Topic 积压能狂加 Consumer 吗","level":"extra","summary":"同 Queue 仍单线程，扩容要 加 Queue + 调整 key 路由，不能单靠加…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同 Queue 仍单线程，扩容要 加 Queue + 调整 key 路由，不能单靠加人。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息积压问题如何解决"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ提供了哪些消息过滤机制","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ提供了哪些消息过滤机制","level":"core","summary":"过滤可以在 Broker 服务端 做，减轻网络；也可以在 Consumer 本地 做…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"过滤可以在 Broker 服务端 做，减轻网络；也可以在 Consumer 本地 做，灵活但浪费带宽。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Tag 过滤（最常用）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消息设 Tag（如 "},{"t":"code","v":"TagA || TagB"},{"t":"text","v":" 订阅表达式）。Broker 根据 ConsumeQueue 里 Tag HashCode 与订阅匹配，不匹配的不返回。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"简单、性能好，适合 粗粒度 分类。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Tag 不宜过多过碎，设计时当 枚举级 用。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"SQL92 属性过滤"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消息 UserProperty 设键值，订阅带 SQL92 表达式（如 "},{"t":"code","v":"amount > 100 AND region = 'CN'"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 解析属性过滤，灵活但 CPU 开销大，属性要规范、类型一致。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"老版本/配置可能需开 enablePropertyFilter，生产要压测。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ClassFilter（了解）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"自定义 Filter 类部署在 Broker，灵活度最高，运维复杂，面试提一句即可。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费端过滤"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"拉全 Tag 后在 "},{"t":"code","v":"consumeMessage"},{"t":"text","v":" 里 if 丢弃：实现快，流量全进客户端，高 QPS 不推荐。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Kafka 对比"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka 常用 Topic 拆分 或 Header 过滤（版本相关）；RocketMQ Tag 是一等公民，SQL92 是特色（也有成本）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"设计建议"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"能 Tag 就不 SQL92。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"过滤条件与 订阅 Group 规划一致，避免一个 Group 订阅 "},{"t":"code","v":"*"},{"t":"text","v":" 再本地过滤。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"广播模式的过滤"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"广播下每台都拉消息，服务端过滤仍省网卡，但 CPU 仍在每台执行，Tag 设计更重要。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"面试陷阱"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"「用 SQL92 随便查」——实际要 预定义属性、压测 Broker CPU；复杂规则放 消费端 + 缓存 有时更稳。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ提供了哪些消息过滤机制-Tag-和-Key-区别","module":"rocketmq","title":"Tag 和 Key 区别","level":"extra","summary":"Tag 用于 订阅过滤；Key 用于 索引查询、业务追踪，职责不同。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Tag 用于 订阅过滤；Key 用于 索引查询、业务追踪，职责不同。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ提供了哪些消息过滤机制"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ提供了哪些消息过滤机制-SQL92-过滤失败常见原因","module":"rocketmq","title":"SQL92 过滤失败常见原因","level":"extra","summary":"属性没设、大小写/类型不对、表达式超 Broker 限制；消息被拒或拉不到。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"属性没设、大小写/类型不对、表达式超 Broker 限制；消息被拒或拉不到。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ提供了哪些消息过滤机制"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的广播消息和集群消息有什么区别","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ的广播消息和集群消息有什么区别","level":"core","summary":"由 MessageModel 决定：CLUSTERING（集群） vs BROADC…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"由 "},{"t":"code","v":"MessageModel"},{"t":"text","v":" 决定：CLUSTERING（集群） vs BROADCASTING（广播）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"集群模式（默认）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同一 Consumer Group 内，每条消息 只被一个实例 消费。Queue 在实例间 Rebalance 分摊，横向扩展消费吞吐。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"适用：订单处理、扣库存、写库等 只需处理一次 的业务。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"广播模式"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同一 Group 内 每个 Consumer 实例都会收到全量消息（每个实例各自拉一份，逻辑上「人人一份」）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"适用：本地缓存刷新、配置下发、每台机器都要感知 的场景。不适合「只扣一次库存」。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Offset 存储差异（印象）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"集群：消费进度 Offset 存 Broker（协调存储），组内共享进度，实例挂了换别人续消费。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"广播：进度 存 Consumer 本地文件（如 "},{"t":"code","v":".rocketmq_offsets"},{"t":"text","v":"），每台自己记， 换机器进度不跟走，要业务能接受重新消费或自己存进度。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Rebalance"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"集群模式 Rebalance 频繁；广播 不参与 Queue 分摊竞争（各实例消费全部 Queue 的消息，实现上仍拉各 Queue，但不做「只一人消费」语义）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Kafka 对比"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka Consumer Group 默认类似 集群；没有一等公民「广播 API」，常用手动 不同 Group 各消费一遍 模拟广播。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"选型口诀"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"「要分摊、只处理一次 → 集群；每台都要 → 广播，并接受本地 Offset。」"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同一 Group 能混用吗"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不能；MessageModel 在 Consumer 实例级配置，同 Group 必须一致，否则 Rebalance 行为异常。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"典型误用"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"把 扣库存 做成广播，每台 Consumer 各扣一次，直接 超卖；写库类必须 CLUSTERING。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的广播消息和集群消息有什么区别-广播模式能水平扩展吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"广播模式能水平扩展吗","level":"extra","summary":"不能通过加人 分担同一条消息；加实例是 多份重复处理，用于多机各自更新本地状态。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不能通过加人 分担同一条消息；加实例是 多份重复处理，用于多机各自更新本地状态。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的广播消息和集群消息有什么区别"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的广播消息和集群消息有什么区别-广播-+-写库会怎样","module":"rocketmq","title":"广播 + 写库会怎样","level":"extra","summary":"每条消息 N 台写 N 次，除非业务幂等或只读本地，否则会 重复写。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"每条消息 N 台写 N 次，除非业务幂等或只读本地，否则会 重复写。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的广播消息和集群消息有什么区别"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的消息存储如何进行清理和归档","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ的消息存储如何进行清理和归档","level":"core","summary":"RocketMQ Broker 按时间与磁盘水位自动删，不是企业归档系统；长期留存要…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ Broker 按时间与磁盘水位自动删，不是企业归档系统；长期留存要 外置备份或同步到冷存储。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"默认过期删除"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"fileReservedTime"},{"t":"text","v":"（常见 72 小时，可配）：CommitLog 中 超过保留时长 的文件会被标记删除。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"删除是 物理文件级，ConsumeQueue、IndexFile 随 CommitLog 进度 对齐清理（Reput 与 check 机制维护一致性）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"磁盘水位强制删"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"diskMaxUsedSpaceRatio"},{"t":"text","v":"（如 75%～90%）：磁盘使用率超阈值，无视保留时间 删最老 CommitLog，防止 Broker 写满挂掉。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生产必须 磁盘告警，否则业务还在查的消息可能已被删。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不是业务「归档」"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"MQ 清理是 为释放空间，不提供「按订单号归档到 OSS」产品能力。合规留存要："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Consumer 同步落库/对象存储；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"或 同步复制到 Kafka/数仓 做冷数据。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"手动与运维"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"停止写入 + 拷贝 "},{"t":"code","v":"store"},{"t":"text","v":" 目录做 冷备（需专业运维，版本一致）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"mqadmin"},{"t":"text","v":" 查状态、改 retain 配置；改保留时间 不追溯 已删数据。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和消费进度"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Consumer Offset 指向已删物理位置时，可能 拉不到历史，报 offset 越界类问题，需重置或从最新消费。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"延迟与事务内部 Topic"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Schedule、重试、死信 Topic 也有保留策略，堆积 + 短保留会 丢延迟/重试消息，要单独监控。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"业务归档正确姿势"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"对账、审计：消费时双写 业务库/OSS；MQ 只保留 可重放窗口（如 3～7 天），不是永久库。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"mqadmin 印象"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"clusterList"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"consumeProgress"},{"t":"text","v":" 看堆积与 Offset；删文件级操作 生产慎做，优先调 retain 与扩容磁盘。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的消息存储如何进行清理和归档-能把保留时间调到一年吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"能把保留时间调到一年吗","level":"extra","summary":"可以调大，但 磁盘成本 高；MQ 不适合当长期仓库，一年数据应落业务库或湖。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"可以调大，但 磁盘成本 高；MQ 不适合当长期仓库，一年数据应落业务库或湖。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的消息存储如何进行清理和归档"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的消息存储如何进行清理和归档-删-CommitLog-ConsumeQueue-会不会-orphan","module":"rocketmq","title":"删 CommitLog ConsumeQueue 会不会 orphan","level":"extra","summary":"Broker 有定时 对齐与纠正 逻辑；正常关机删旧文件是配套删索引，异常宕机靠启动…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 有定时 对齐与纠正 逻辑；正常关机删旧文件是配套删索引，异常宕机靠启动 check。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的消息存储如何进行清理和归档"},{"id":"rocketmq-为什么不建议用MQ实现订单到期关闭","module":"rocketmq","title":"为什么不建议用MQ实现订单到期关闭","level":"core","summary":"关单要 在指定时刻（或超时后）精确触发，听起来像延迟消息；用 RocketMQ 做 …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"关单要 在指定时刻（或超时后）精确触发，听起来像延迟消息；用 RocketMQ 做 往往踩精度、堆积、运维边界。拓展 "},{"t":"code","v":"03"},{"t":"text","v":" 讲延迟队列概念，本篇讲 订单关单 落地。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"固定延迟等级对不齐"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ 4.x 延迟是 18 档等级（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"12"},{"t":"text","v":"），不是「下单后恰好 30 分钟」。关单时间会有 分钟级误差，和支付超时文案、对账规则冲突。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"5.x 定时也不是万能"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"定时能力增强仍受 Broker 实现、堆积、版本 约束；大促海量订单全走 MQ 定时，Schedule 内部 Topic 易堆积，扫描线程成为瓶颈。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"堆积与可见性"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"流量高峰延迟消息 排队，关单 晚于 真实超时，用户仍可能付款成功但订单已关，或相反，要复杂 状态机 + 幂等 兜底，复杂度转移到 MQ 外。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"业务状态应以 DB 为准"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"可靠做法是：订单表 "},{"t":"code","v":"expire_time"},{"t":"text","v":" + 索引，配合："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"定时任务（分片扫即将过期）；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"时间轮（Netty HashedWheel，单机/集群调度）；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Redis ZSET delay queue（要记住持久化与集群）；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"或 专业调度（XXL-JOB、SchedulerX）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"MQ 适合发 「已关单」领域事件 通知下游，不适合当 唯一计时器。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和延迟消息的正确分工"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"下单后发 普通消息 做异步；超时关单由 调度系统触发；关单成功后发 MQ 解耦 库存、优惠券释放。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"口述收束"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"「MQ 延迟适合 粗粒度提醒；订单关单要 精确、可查询、可审计，用 DB 时间 + 调度更稳。」"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"若已用 MQ 关单怎么补救"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"订单状态机 以 DB expire_time 为准；MQ 消息只作 触发尝试，关单前 再查支付状态；延迟档位误差用 宽限期 消化。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和拓展延迟题"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"03.死信队列和延迟队列"},{"t":"text","v":" 讲概念；RocketMQ 实现是 等级 + Schedule，别当成 Redis 延迟队列替代品。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-为什么不建议用MQ实现订单到期关闭-那延迟消息完全不能关单吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"那延迟消息完全不能关单吗","level":"extra","summary":"极小流量、误差可接受、有状态机兜底时可以 辅助；核心链路别只押 MQ 定时。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"极小流量、误差可接受、有状态机兜底时可以 辅助；核心链路别只押 MQ 定时。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-为什么不建议用MQ实现订单到期关闭"},{"id":"rocketmq-为什么不建议用MQ实现订单到期关闭-事务消息能一起关单吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"事务消息能一起关单吗","level":"extra","summary":"事务消息解决 发消息与本地事务一致，不解决 何时触发；触发仍要调度或延迟能力边界内设…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"事务消息解决 发消息与本地事务一致，不解决 何时触发；触发仍要调度或延迟能力边界内设计。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-为什么不建议用MQ实现订单到期关闭"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ生产环境如何优化","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ生产环境如何优化","level":"core","summary":"优化分 Broker 存储与复制、JVM/OS、Topic 与消费者、监控治理 四层…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"优化分 Broker 存储与复制、JVM/OS、Topic 与消费者、监控治理 四层，别只调一个参数。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"刷盘与复制权衡"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"核心 Topic：SYNC_FLUSH + SYNC_MASTER，接受 RT 换不丢。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"日志/埋点 Topic：ASYNC_FLUSH + ASYNC_MASTER，换吞吐。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"按 Topic 分级，不要全集群一种配置。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"JVM 与 OS"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker：堆适中（过多堆挤压 PageCache，CommitLog 靠 OS Cache）；G1 常用。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"vm.swappiness"},{"t":"text","v":" 调低，避免 swap 拖死延迟；磁盘独立、XFS，避免与日志盘抢 IO。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"页缓存与磁盘"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"保证 磁盘带宽余量；"},{"t":"code","v":"flushDiskType"},{"t":"text","v":"、CommitLog 分段大小默认即可，除非压测证明瓶颈。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"多 Master 水平拆 Topic Queue，单机 QPS 到顶就加 Broker。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Queue 数与消费者"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Queue 数 ≥ 峰值期望 并行度（Consumer 实例数），又不宜过多（元数据与 Rebalance 成本）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费线程池、"},{"t":"code","v":"consumeThreadMin/Max"},{"t":"text","v":" 与 下游连接池 匹配，避免线程空转或 DB 打满。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Producer 侧"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同步超时、重试次数、批量大小；避免超大 Body；核心链路 异步 send + 回调补偿 要设计好。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"监控与告警"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"堆积、消费延迟、Send RT、Broker put/get TPS、磁盘使用率、复制 lag。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"核心 Topic 隔离：独立 Broker 集群或资源组，避免被日志 Topic 拖垮。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"其他"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"NameServer 至少 2 节点；Broker 多 Master 多 Slave 或 DLedger（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"23"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"定期演练 Master 切换、消费重置；文档化 "},{"t":"code","v":"%RETRY%"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"%DLQ%"},{"t":"text","v":" 处理流程。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"发送 RT 优化"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"批量、压缩、就近 同机房 Broker；避免跨地域同步复制 unless 必须。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费侧 GC"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"大消息、大 JSON 解析导致 频繁 Young GC 也会表现为消费慢，Profiler 与堆积一起看。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ生产环境如何优化-堆越大-Broker-越快吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"堆越大 Broker 越快吗","level":"extra","summary":"不一定；CommitLog 依赖 OS PageCache，堆过大反而减少可用 Ca…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不一定；CommitLog 依赖 OS PageCache，堆过大反而减少可用 Cache，常建议 8G 内或按官方实践 压测。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ生产环境如何优化"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ生产环境如何优化-消费者越多越快吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"消费者越多越快吗","level":"extra","summary":"超过 Queue 数无效；下游瓶颈时越多越慢，见 14。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"超过 Queue 数无效；下游瓶颈时越多越慢，见 "},{"t":"code","v":"14"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ生产环境如何优化"},{"id":"rocketmq-NameServer是做什么的","module":"rocketmq","title":"NameServer是做什么的","level":"core","summary":"NameServer 是 RocketMQ 的 路由注册中心，轻量、无状态、无集群间…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"NameServer 是 RocketMQ 的 路由注册中心，轻量、无状态、无集群间数据同步，只负责 Broker 地址与 Topic 路由信息 的存取。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"核心职责"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 注册：Broker 启动时向 NameServer 上报：BrokerName、BrokerId（Master/Slave）、地址、HA 信息。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"心跳保活：Broker 定时心跳；超时 NameServer 剔除 失效节点。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"路由查询：Producer/Consumer 拉取 TopicRouteData——Topic 在哪些 Broker、每个 Broker 几个 MessageQueue、权限等。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"客户端怎么用"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"配置 "},{"t":"code","v":"namesrvAddr"},{"t":"text","v":" 多个地址，客户端 轮询/ failover 访问。本地 缓存路由，定时更新（默认约 30s），发送失败也会 强制刷新。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"无状态含义"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"各 NameServer 实例 独立，Broker 向 所有 NameServer 注册；实例间 不复制。某台 NameServer 挂了，连其他实例即可；最终一致：短暂窗口内不同客户端路由可能略旧，靠 Broker 不可用时的 重试 兜底。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 ZooKeeper / Eureka"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ZK：强一致协调，RocketMQ 刻意不用 ZK 减运维与脑裂复杂度。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Eureka：应用注册；NameServer 只服务 MQ 路由，不存 Consumer 实例列表（Consumer 由 Broker 协调 Offset 与 Rebalance）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不存消息"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"NameServer 不落消息、不存 Offset，挂掉 不影响已存 Broker 数据，只影响 发现与路由。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"部署建议"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生产 ≥2 台，与 Broker 分机部署；防火墙放通 Broker↔NameServer、Client↔NameServer。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"路由不一致窗口"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 刚上线，部分客户端缓存旧路由 几十秒；发送失败触发 fetchNewRoute 是正常自愈路径。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"为什么不合并进 Broker"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"NameServer 极轻，独立扩容 路由查询 不拖累 IO 重的 Broker；故障域也分开。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-NameServer是做什么的-NameServer-会单点吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"NameServer 会单点吗","level":"extra","summary":"单实例是单点；多实例 无状态，客户端配多个即可，不是传统主备 NameServer。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"单实例是单点；多实例 无状态，客户端配多个即可，不是传统主备 NameServer。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-NameServer是做什么的"},{"id":"rocketmq-NameServer是做什么的-Broker-怎么知道连哪个-NameServer","module":"rocketmq","title":"Broker 怎么知道连哪个 NameServer","level":"extra","summary":"Broker 配置同样 namesrvAddr 列表，向 全部 注册心跳。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 配置同样 "},{"t":"code","v":"namesrvAddr"},{"t":"text","v":" 列表，向 全部 注册心跳。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-NameServer是做什么的"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Topic和MessageQueue是什么关系","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ的Topic和MessageQueue是什么关系","level":"core","summary":"Topic 是逻辑分类；MessageQueue 是 Topic 在 某个 Brok…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Topic 是逻辑分类；MessageQueue 是 Topic 在 某个 Broker 上的物理分片，消费并行与顺序的基本单位。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Topic"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生产者、消费者订阅的 名字空间，如 "},{"t":"code","v":"OrderTopic"},{"t":"text","v":"。本身不存数据，是 路由与权限 上的概念。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"MessageQueue"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"一个 Topic 在 单个 Broker 上拆成 多个 Queue（创建 Topic 时指定 "},{"t":"code","v":"writeQueueNums"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"readQueueNums"},{"t":"text","v":"，通常一致）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Queue 标识：Topic + BrokerName + QueueId。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同 Topic 的 Queue 分布在多个 Broker 上，由 NameServer 路由汇总。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"并行与顺序"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"并行：多 Queue 多 Consumer 实例分摊，提高吞吐。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"顺序：同一 Queue 内有序（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"13"},{"t":"text","v":"）；全局顺序 = 只用 1 个 Queue（一般不这么做）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Kafka Partition 类比"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 概念 | RocketMQ | Kafka |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"|------|----------|-------|"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 逻辑主题 | Topic | Topic |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 分片 | MessageQueue | Partition |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 物理位置 | Broker 上的 Queue | Broker 上的 Partition Log |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka Partition 绑定 Leader；RocketMQ Queue 绑定 Broker，Master-Slave 复制整 Broker CommitLog。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"创建与扩容"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"updateTopic"},{"t":"text","v":" / 控制台可 增加 Queue 数；已有消息 不会迁移，新 Queue 只收新消息；顺序哈希 key 可能变化要评估。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"读写队列数"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"可配 read/write Queue 数不一致（少见），一般 读写相同，避免路由混乱。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"默认 Queue 数"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"新建 Topic 常见 4、8、16，看吞吐与 Consumer 规模；过少易热点，过多 Rebalance 与元数据开销升。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"发送时的 Queue 选择"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"默认轮询 所有 Writable Queue；故障 Broker 的 Queue 会从路由里剔除，Producer 自动跳过。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Topic和MessageQueue是什么关系-一个-Queue-只能在一个-Broker-吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"一个 Queue 只能在一个 Broker 吗","level":"extra","summary":"是，Queue 归属 某一 Broker；Topic 跨 Broker 靠 多个 Q…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"是，Queue 归属 某一 Broker；Topic 跨 Broker 靠 多个 Queue 分布在多 Broker。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Topic和MessageQueue是什么关系"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Topic和MessageQueue是什么关系-Consumer-Group-和-Topic-关系","module":"rocketmq","title":"Consumer Group 和 Topic 关系","level":"extra","summary":"Group 订阅 Topic；Rebalance 把 Topic 下 所有 Queu…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Group 订阅 Topic；Rebalance 把 Topic 下 所有 Queue 分给组内实例，不是 Topic 级独占。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ的Topic和MessageQueue是什么关系"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ和Kafka有什么区别","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ和Kafka有什么区别","level":"core","summary":"选型见拓展 02.如何进行消息队列选型；这里对比 模型、能力、运维，便于面试口述。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"选型见拓展 "},{"t":"code","v":"02.如何进行消息队列选型"},{"t":"text","v":"；这里对比 模型、能力、运维，便于面试口述。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"设计定位"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ：阿里系 业务消息，强调 事务消息、延迟等级、顺序、金融级可靠。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka：LinkedIn 日志流/事件流，强调 超高吞吐、流处理生态（Connect、Streams）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"存储模型"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ：单 CommitLog + ConsumeQueue 索引（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"07"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka：每 Partition 独立 Log Segment，顺序写，分区并行明显。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费模型"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"两者 Consumer 都是 Pull（RocketMQ SDK 长轮询包装成 Push 体验）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka 依赖 Group Coordinator；RocketMQ 用 NameServer 路由 + Broker Offset。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"特色能力"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 能力 | RocketMQ | Kafka |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"|------|----------|-------|"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 事务消息 | 原生半消息 | 0.11+ 事务（流场景） |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 延迟 | 固定等级 / 5.x 定时 | 无内置延迟（靠外部） |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 消息过滤 | Tag、SQL92 | 主要靠 Topic 划分 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 顺序 | MessageQueue | Partition |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"吞吐与堆积"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka 在大集群、纯日志管道场景 吞吐记录常更高；RocketMQ 在 混合 Topic、事务、定时 业务场景更顺手。两者都能堆积，都怕 消费跟不上 + 保留删数据。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"运维与社区"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka 国际生态更大（云原生、监控工具多）；RocketMQ 国内文档、云产品、中间件团队 多，Apache 顶级项目。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ 5.x 向 云原生、存算分离 演进；Kafka 向 KRaft、分层存储 演进。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"怎么选（口述）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"大数据管道、Flink 入湖、行为日志 → Kafka 优先。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"电商订单、支付通知、事务一致、延迟档位 → RocketMQ 常见。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"团队熟谁用谁， 别为了中间件而中间件。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"运维体感"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka 分区再均衡、ISR 运维话题多；RocketMQ Master-Slave 切换、NameServer 最终一致 要熟。云厂商两者都有托管版。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消息语义"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"两者主流都是 至少一次；Exactly Once 都要 业务层 补。RocketMQ 事务消息更贴 本地库+发消息 对齐。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ和Kafka有什么区别-RocketMQ-能完全替代-Kafka-吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ 能完全替代 Kafka 吗","level":"extra","summary":"看场景；流平台、超大规模日志管道 Kafka 更常见；业务 MQ 能力 Rocket…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"看场景；流平台、超大规模日志管道 Kafka 更常见；业务 MQ 能力 RocketMQ 更贴。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ和Kafka有什么区别"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ和Kafka有什么区别-两者能混用吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"两者能混用吗","level":"extra","summary":"可以：Kafka 做日志总线，RocketMQ 做业务域事件，通过 同步任务/Con…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"可以：Kafka 做日志总线，RocketMQ 做业务域事件，通过 同步任务/Connect 桥接，要接受 最终一致与运维成本。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ和Kafka有什么区别"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证高可用","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ如何保证高可用","level":"core","summary":"拓展 04.如何保证消息队列的高可用 讲通用思路；RocketMQ 靠 多 Name…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"拓展 "},{"t":"code","v":"04.如何保证消息队列的高可用"},{"t":"text","v":" 讲通用思路；RocketMQ 靠 多 NameServer、Broker 多副本、复制与切换、客户端重试 落地。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"NameServer 层"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"多实例 无状态，Broker 向全部注册，客户端配 多个 namesrv 地址。单台挂不影响消息已落盘数据，只影响短暂路由刷新。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 层：Master-Slave"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"每个 Master 配 Slave，异步或同步复制 CommitLog。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Master 宕机：异步模式可能 丢未复制段；同步模式已 ACK 的消息 Slave 有副本。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"传统架构 Slave 提 Master 常需运维介入或脚本；RTO 取决于流程。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"DLedger 自动切换"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"多副本 Raft 选主，Leader 故障 自动 failover，适合对 RPO/RTO 要求更高的集群（部署与硬件成本更高）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生产与消费侧"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Producer：同步 send + 失败重试 + 多 Broker 路由；Broker 不可用时换 Queue/Broker。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Consumer：Rebalance 后从 其他 Broker/副本 拉；Offset 在 Broker 侧协调（集群模式）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"数据不丢 vs 高可用"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"SYNC_MASTER + SYNC_FLUSH 可用性略降（Master 慢或 Slave lag 会 block ACK），但 RPO 更好。按 Topic 分级 SLA。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"机房与部署"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Broker 跨机架/跨 AZ 部署 Slave；NameServer 与 Broker 分离；避免 单机房全灭 无异地副本。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"限流与隔离"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"核心 Topic 独立集群；防止非核心流量拖垮共享 Broker，导致 假高可用（进程在但不可用）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"客户端容错"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Producer/Consumer 内置 重试与路由刷新；NameServer 全挂且缓存过期时 无法发收，HA 不等于 NameServer 可单点。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RTO/RPO 口述"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"异步复制：RPO > 0；同步复制 + 同步刷盘：RPO 接近 0，RT 升；DLedger：自动切换，RTO 分钟级内（视部署）。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证高可用-Slave-能否读消息","module":"rocketmq","title":"Slave 能否读消息","level":"extra","summary":"配置允许时 Consumer 可从 Slave 读，减轻 Master 读压；写仍在…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"配置允许时 Consumer 可从 Slave 读，减轻 Master 读压；写仍在 Master（DLedger 除外统一走 Leader）。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证高可用"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证高可用-和-Kafka-ISR-像吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"和 Kafka ISR 像吗","level":"extra","summary":"思想类似 副本同步集合；RocketMQ 经典是 Master-Slave 角色固定…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"思想类似 副本同步集合；RocketMQ 经典是 Master-Slave 角色固定，DLedger 更接近 Raft ISR 自动选主。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ如何保证高可用"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息重复消费怎么处理","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ消息重复消费怎么处理","level":"core","summary":"RocketMQ 默认 至少一次（At Least Once）：网络重试、Rebal…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ 默认 至少一次（At Least Once）：网络重试、Rebalance、消费成功但 Commit Offset 前 crash 都会 再次投递。通用幂等思路见拓展 "},{"t":"code","v":"08.如何解决重复消费"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"为什么会重复"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Producer 重试 导致 Broker 两条（需业务 去重键 或 Broker 幂等，4.x 常靠消费端）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Consumer 处理成功但 Offset 未提交 重启后再拉。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Rebalance 导致重复消费窗口。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费失败进 %RETRY% 延迟再投，业务未区分重试与首次。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费端幂等（主战场）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"数据库唯一键：订单号、消息Id 插入，冲突则当已处理。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"状态机：只允许 "},{"t":"code","v":"CREATED → PAID"},{"t":"text","v":"，重复 "},{"t":"code","v":"PAID"},{"t":"text","v":" 直接返回成功。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Redis SETNX："},{"t":"code","v":"msgId"},{"t":"text","v":" 或业务键，TTL 覆盖重试窗口。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"业务表乐观锁 / version 更新。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"利用 MessageId / Keys"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"发送时设 Keys（业务单号），消费端 先查是否已处理 再执行业务；Keys 不是 Broker 自动去重，是 你自己查。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Offset 的关系"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"幂等解决 重复；不要靠「跳过 Offset」赌不重复。处理成功再 CONSUME_SUCCESS。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"顺序消费"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"顺序 Listener 重试会 阻塞 Queue；幂等更要做好，否则重试风暴卡死后续消息。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和死信"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"反复失败进 %DLQ%（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"25"},{"t":"text","v":"），人工修复后要避免 再重复写。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"发送端去重（弱）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"极端情况下 Producer 重试产生 两条相同业务消息，消费端仍按 业务键幂等；不要假设 Broker 自动合并。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"日志与对账"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"记录 msgId + 业务键 + 处理结果；日终对账发现重复处理记录，反查幂等表是否漏设。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息重复消费怎么处理-Broker-能去重吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"Broker 能去重吗","level":"extra","summary":"RocketMQ 不提供通用 全链路 Exactly Once；5.x/插件可能有有…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RocketMQ 不提供通用 全链路 Exactly Once；5.x/插件可能有有限能力，面试答 消费幂等 最稳。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息重复消费怎么处理"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息重复消费怎么处理-和-Kafka-幂等-Producer-区别","module":"rocketmq","title":"和 Kafka 幂等 Producer 区别","level":"extra","summary":"Kafka 生产者 Pid + Sequence 可单分区去重；RocketMQ 重…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kafka 生产者 Pid + Sequence 可单分区去重；RocketMQ 重点在 消费端业务幂等。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ消息重复消费怎么处理"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ死信队列是怎么回事","module":"rocketmq","title":"RocketMQ死信队列是怎么回事","level":"core","summary":"消费 多次重试仍失败 的消息，会进入 死信队列（Dead Letter Queue）…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费 多次重试仍失败 的消息，会进入 死信队列（Dead Letter Queue），避免无限堵在正常 Topic。拓展 "},{"t":"code","v":"03.死信队列和延迟队列"},{"t":"text","v":" 有通用概念；RocketMQ 命名与 重试 Topic 绑定。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"重试再死信"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费返回 RECONSUME_LATER 或抛异常，Broker 把消息投到 "},{"t":"code","v":"%RETRY%"},{"t":"text","v":" + ConsumerGroup 的重试 Topic。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"按 延迟等级 间隔重试（默认最多 16 次 左右，可配 "},{"t":"code","v":"maxReconsumeTimes"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"仍失败 → 进入 "},{"t":"code","v":"%DLQ%"},{"t":"text","v":" + ConsumerGroup 死信 Topic，不再自动消费。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"谁在处理死信"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"默认 没有 Consumer 订阅 DLQ，要 单独写消费者 或运维用 "},{"t":"code","v":"mqadmin"},{"t":"text","v":" 导出、人工修复、重新发送。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"常见进 DLQ 原因"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"下游 DB 字段变更、NPE、 poison message（格式永远错）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"消费超时、线程池满导致 假失败 也会重试耗尽。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"顺序消费 一条卡死 后相关消息堆积，极端也进 DLQ。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和延迟 Topic 关系"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"重试走 内部 RETRY + delay level；业务延迟走 Schedule Topic（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"12"},{"t":"text","v":"）。排查堆积要 分清 Topic 名字。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生产实践"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"监控 DLQ 消息数，告警。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"修复根因后：转发回原 Topic 或手动补偿；处理时要 幂等（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"24"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"测试环境可调低重试次数便于验证。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"能否自定义 DLQ 名"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"默认 "},{"t":"code","v":"%DLQ%ConsumerGroup"},{"t":"text","v":"；定制较少见，口述默认规则即可。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"告警与值班"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"DLQ 有新消息 P0 告警； playbook：看堆栈 → 修代码/数据 → 单条重投 → 验证幂等。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"maxReconsumeTimes"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"调小更快进 DLQ，少堵 正常 Queue；调大延迟故障暴露，按业务容忍度配置。"}]}]},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ死信队列是怎么回事-死信会被自动删吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"死信会被自动删吗","level":"extra","summary":"受 Broker 保留策略 影响（见 17），久不处理可能 过期删除，要尽早告警。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"受 Broker 保留策略 影响（见 "},{"t":"code","v":"17"},{"t":"text","v":"），久不处理可能 过期删除，要尽早告警。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ死信队列是怎么回事"},{"id":"rocketmq-RocketMQ死信队列是怎么回事-重试-Topic-消费者要订阅吗","module":"rocketmq","title":"重试 Topic 消费者要订阅吗","level":"extra","summary":"不用；Broker 自动投递重试，再失败转 DLQ。业务只订阅 业务 Topic。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不用；Broker 自动投递重试，再失败转 DLQ。业务只订阅 业务 Topic。"}]}],"parentId":"rocketmq-RocketMQ死信队列是怎么回事"}]
